# tools/cp/hunt/r4/cold-lvp-m86.p9 -- lane H9-hunt4 (docs/cp-hunt.md round 4): a
# lavapipe cold boot (HUNT_GPU=lavapipe: the game on the CPU) as far as it gets:
# main menu -> LOAD GAME -> ManualSave-86 -> loading -> the world -> a short
# walk -> QUIT GAME from the pause menu.  cold-m86-pq.p9 with every timeout
# stretched for CPU rendering; boot_p9's `phase` rows time each step
# (menu, loadlist, loading, world, walk, quit).
phase menu
shot menu
keytiming 300 1500
seek menu-load main down 6 LOAD GAME
key ret
phase loadlist
expect loadlist 120 LOAD\s*GAME|Expand\s*groups|Coll\w*\s*groups|Progression
key 0
wait 6
listseek loadlist-focus down 8 509
phase loading
key ret
expect loaded 2400 PRESS\b.{0,24}\bTO\s+CONTINUE
key spc
wait 20
phase world
expect inworld 900 RIPPERDOC|Jackie|Draw\s+Weapon
shot world-start
phase walk
repeat 3
hold w 6000
look 350 0 15 30
hold w 4000
wait 6
shot cw
end
phase quit
key esc
wait 15
seek pause-quit pause down 9 QUIT GAME
exit_ok
key ret
wait 8
expect quit-confirm 60 sure.{0,20}quit
key ret
wait_exit 600
